\newlabel{fig:noisebudget}{{7}{12}{\textbf {Fixed-truth noise budget across arms.} Intra-event width against the resolution the detector requires, and the fraction of the variance carried by the noise, for 14 retained checkpoints spanning the Run E to Run H families. \textnormal {[measured]}}{figure.7}{}}
